# Project Instructions

This file contains instructions for AI agents working on this project.

## System Overview

This workspace uses a **Skills-Based Productivity System** to organize work.
All agents must follow the protocols defined in this repository.

## Key Documents

| Document | Purpose |
|:---|:---|
| `🎛️ MASTER ORCHESTRATION PROTOCOL.md` | Execution protocol — the law |
| `🎯 Skills-Based Productivity System.md` | System overview and quick start |
| `WORK_LOG.md` | Daily action log |

## Workspace Structure

```
.agents/
├── skills/
│   ├── _inbox/              # Capture new ideas here
│   ├── _system/             # Meta-skills (templates, index)
│   │   ├── skill-template.md
│   │   └── skill-index.md
│   └── [project-name]/      # Project-specific skills
│       └── skill.md
├── workflows/
│   ├── triage.md            # /triage — morning inbox processing
│   ├── end-to-end.md        # /end-to-end — focused single-skill work
│   ├── skill-learning.md    # /skill-learning — evening knowledge capture
│   └── first.md             # /first — system overview
└── rules/                   # Project-specific rules
```

## Agent Rules

1. **One Skill = One Focus** — Never work on 2+ skills simultaneously
2. **End-to-End Discipline** — START → Steps → FINISH, no interruptions
3. **Skills Directory is Truth** — All procedural knowledge lives in `.agents/skills/`
4. **Verify Before Execute** — Check before and after major actions
5. **Fail Fast** — If unclear, HALT and ask the user

## Available Workflows

| Command | When | Duration |
|:---|:---|:---|
| `/triage` | Morning — process inbox | 5 min |
| `/end-to-end` | Day — focused work on one skill | Focus time |
| `/skill-learning` | Evening — codify knowledge | 10 min |
| `/first` | Anytime — system overview | 2 min |

## Skill Lifecycle

```
Idea → _inbox/ → /triage → skill.md → /end-to-end → completed → /skill-learning